<Data>Data Flow Analysis : DF1&#x000D;&#x000A;10/23/2017..11:02 AM&#x000D;&#x000A;V5G_RangeCheck &apos;SISO_Design__V5G_DL_Src_1.RangeCheck&apos;: &#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;System Configurations:&#x000D;&#x000A;1. Subframe configurations are :&#x000D;&#x000A;    SF 00~09 : xPBCH,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1&#x000D;&#x000A;    SF 10~19 : DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  xPRACH,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1&#x000D;&#x000A;    SF 20~29 : DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  xPBCH,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1&#x000D;&#x000A;    SF 30~39 : DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1&#x000D;&#x000A;    SF 40~49 : DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1,  DownLink1&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;   The OFDM symbol configurations (Symbol#0~13) for data subframe structure are shown below:&#x000D;&#x000A;   (Dc: DL control channels; Dd: DL data channels; Uc: UL control channels; Ud: UL data channels; GP: guard period)&#x000D;&#x000A;     DownLink1: Dc Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd/C.RS Dd/C.RS&#x000D;&#x000A;     DownLink2: Dc Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd GP Uc/SRS&#x000D;&#x000A;     DownLink3: Dc Dc Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd/C.RS Dd/C.RS&#x000D;&#x000A;     DownLink4: Dc Dc Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd Dd GP Uc/SRS&#x000D;&#x000A;     UpLink1: Dc GP Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud&#x000D;&#x000A;     UpLink2: Dc GP Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Uc/SRS&#x000D;&#x000A;     UpLink3: Dc GP Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud C.RS&#x000D;&#x000A;     UpLink4: Dc GP Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud SRS C.RS&#x000D;&#x000A;     UpLink5: Dc GP Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud Ud SRS Uc&#x000D;&#x000A;     BRRS1: Dc -/Dc B.RS B.RS B.RS B.RS B.RS B.RS B.RS B.RS B.RS 